x tw-justify-between tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-flex tw-shrink-0 tw-flex-col tw-order-last tw-mt-auto"><h3 class="tw-pointer-events-auto tw-type-sm tw-font-normal tw-text-gray-500"><a class="tw-outline-none tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-gap-1.5" data-bento-link="true" href="/text-to-speech">Ultra-realistic speech<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="tw-flex-none tw-size-3 tw-relative tw-top-0.25 tw-transition-opacity tw-opacity-0 can-hover:[[data-bento-link]:hover_&]:tw-opacity-100 [[data-bento-link]:focus-visible_&]:tw-opacity-100"><path d="M18.25 15.25V5.75M18.25 5.75H8.75M18.25 5.75L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3"/></svg><span class="tw-absolute tw-inset-0 tw-z-10"></span></a></h3><p class="tw-mt-4.5 tw-pointer-events-auto tw-text-pretty tw-type-sm tw-text-black">Create controllable, expressive speech layered across 70+ languages.</p></div><div class="tw-relative tw-overflow-visible tw-h-[29.625rem] tw-pointer-events-auto tw-z-20"><audio preload="none" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" crossorigin="anonymous"></audio><div class="tw-flex tw-h-full tw-items-center"><div class="tw-relative tw-isolate tw-bg-white tw-rounded-3xl tw-w-full tw-mx-auto tw-ring-0.5 tw-ring-inset tw-ring-gray-200 -tw-mt-9 tw-max-w-[37rem]"><div class><div class="tw-relative tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-flex-auto tw-overflow-y-auto tw-scroll-pt-4 tw-scroll-pb-6 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-scrollbar-none tw-h-40"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto"><div class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word" inert>In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[sarcastically]</span> Not the “burn it all down” kind... <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[giggles]</span> but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[whispers]</span> Even the birds fell silent when he passed.<!-- -->​</div><textarea class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;resize:none;color:transparent;background-color:transparent" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Enter your text here, ElevenLabs AI Voice Generator will read it for you" maxlength="1000">In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. [sarcastically] Not the “burn it all down” kind... [giggles] but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. [whispers] Even the birds fell silent when he passed.</textarea></div></div><div class="tw-flex-none tw-sticky tw-bottom-0 tw-h-6 tw-bg-gradient-to-t tw-from-white tw-mx-hairline"></div></div><div class="tw-relative tw-z-10 tw-flex tw-items-center tw-gap-1 tw-px-3 tw-pb-3"><template><div class="tw-sticky tw-z-50 tw-h-1.5 tw-top-0 -tw-mb-1.5 tw-pointer-events-auto"></div></template><div class="react-aria-Select" data-rac><button id="react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH2_" class="tw-w-full tw-font-medium tw-text-black tw-flex tw-items-center tw-outline-none tw-transition-colors tw-text-sm/sm tw-gap-2 tw-h-9 tw-rounded-xl tw-pl-3 tw-pr-2 tw-outline-none" data-rac type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-label="Language" aria-labelledby="react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH7_ react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH2_" aria-describedby="react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH5_ react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH6_" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false"><span id="react-aria-_R_26akmbl3f9lfknitmpfivbH7_" class="tw-min-w-0 tw-flex-1" data-rac><div class="tw-relative tw-min-w-0 tw-flex tw-items-baseline tw-gap-2"><img alt loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg