ance tw-transition tw-duration-300 tw-opacity-0 tw-translate-y-1">More expressive voice agents, built for real-world customer conversations.</p><p class="tw-mt-4 tw-type-xs tw-text-gray-500 tw-transition tw-duration-300 tw-opacity-0 tw-translate-y-1">Feb 2026</p></div></div><div class="tw-group tw-outline-none tw-col-span-2 tw-col-start-1 sm:tw-col-auto sm:tw-col-start-2 tw-row-start-1 tw-row-span-full tw-grid tw-grid-cols-1 tw-grid-rows-[subgrid] tw-relative tw-w-full" style="width:round(down, 100%, 8px)" data-rac inert data-inert="true" data-entering="true"><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-64 sm:tw-ml-[var(--ml)] tw-w-full tw-text-center" style="--ml:calc(50% - 5px - round(down, -44.82404692082112%, 9px) - 8rem)"><h3 class="tw-type-base tw-text-black tw-text-balance tw-transition tw-duration-300 tw-opacity-0 -tw-translate-y-1">Music v2</h3></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-64 sm:tw-ml-[var(--ml)] tw-w-full tw-text-center tw-row-start-3 group-focus-visible:tw-outline-focus group-focus-visible:tw-outline-offset-6 tw-rounded" style="--ml:calc(50% - 5px - round(down, -44.82404692082112%, 9px) - 8rem)"><p class="tw-type-xs tw-text-black tw-text-balance tw-transition tw-duration-300 tw-opacity-0 tw-translate-y-1">Better vocals, instrumentation, and arrangement across every genre.</p><p class="tw-mt-4 tw-type-xs tw-text-gray-500 tw-transition tw-duration-300 tw-opacity-0 tw-translate-y-1">May 2026</p></div></div><div id="react-aria-_R_4tbmjf9lfknitmpfivbH1_-tabpanel-event-10" aria-labelledby="react-aria-_R_4tbmjf9lfknitmpfivbH1_-tab-event-10" tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" class="tw-group tw-outline-none tw-col-span-2 tw-col-start-1 sm:tw-col-auto sm:tw-col-start-2 tw-row-start-1 tw-row-span-full tw-grid tw-grid-cols-1 tw-grid-rows-[subgrid] tw-relative tw-w-full" style="width:round(down, 100%, 8px)" data-rac><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-64 sm:tw-ml-[var(--ml)] tw-w-full tw-text-center" style="--ml:calc(50% - 5px - round(down, -45%, 9px) - 8rem)"><h3 class="tw-type-b