ll - Suspense, Mystery and Thriller - A middle age American voice which captures the tone and pace of your favorite mystery or suspense novel.  Great for audiobooks and True Crime content. \"},{\"voiceId\":\"yl2ZDV1MzN4HbQJbMihG\",\"name\":\"Alex - Social Media\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-prod/custom/voices/yl2ZDV1MzN4HbQJbMihG/TxJIOexqYqCv1Dzexs6Y.mp3\",\"category\":\"Entertainment\",\"description\":\"Alex - Young American Male - An upbeat and pleasant male voice. Great for Youtube, shorts and social media.\",\"shortDescription\":\"Broadcast-ready voices for shows, trailers, and promos.\",\"link\":\"https://elevenlabs.io/app/voice-library?use_cases=entertainment_tv\"},{\"voiceId\":\"kqVT88a5QfII1HNAEPTJ\",\"name\":\"Declan Sage - Authoritative Storyteller\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-prod/database/workspace/5d6438deeb7d443ca0a6fc6309d5bb8a/voices/kqVT88a5QfII1HNAEPTJ/550e9e8b-e80e-4d43-b95e-ccd3cd42875d.mp3\",\"category\":\"Narration\",\"description\":\"Declan Sage - Wise, Deliberate, Captivating - A deep, resonant male voice with a standard American accent and a slight husky and raspy quality but still pleasant. It has a controlled, measured, and direct delivery, perfect for authoritative narrations, compelling audiobooks, and professional voiceover requiring gravitas and clarity.\"},{\"voiceId\":\"NNl6r8mD7vthiJatiJt1\",\"name\":\"Bradford - Articulated Storyteller\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://api.us.elevenlabs.io/v1/voices/NNl6r8mD7vthiJatiJt1/previews/audio?payload=eyJ2b2ljZV9zb3VyY2UiOiJjdXN0b20iLCJ1c2VyX2lkIjoiQ0VaWHhmZENmRWZ5WEQ3eVVOS0lQY3VDS2FCMyIsImZpbGVuYW1lIjoiMTljNDkyZGQtNGVlMC00NjhhLTk2MzItNDU1ZThmNGE0ZjA4Lm1wMyIsInRpbWVzdGFtcCI6MTc4NjU1NzYwMDAwMDAwMH0%3D\",\"category\":\"Narration\",\"description\":\"Bradford - An adult British Male Storyteller. Expressive, articulate, and engaging!\"},{\"voiceId\":\"XjLkpWUlnhS8i7gGz3lZ\",\"name\":\"David Castlemore - Newsreader\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-prod/database/user/T7bhqxLyENgRaSgfnqhPa6vPSID2/voices/XjLkpWUlnhS8i7gGz3lZ/2foqwf4lPNBPWW27H6du.mp3\",\"category\":\"Narration\",\"description\":\"A clear and crisp middle age professional American voice that is in the style of Broadcast news presenters.  Great for the reader app for long form content. \"},{\"voiceId\":\"j9jfwdrw7BRfcR43Qohk\",\"name\":\"Frederick Surrey - Science Storyteller\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-prod/custom/voices/j9jfwdrw7BRfcR43Qohk/Vyj86dr4NJ1Tr82nEPdw.mp3\",\"category\":\"Narration\",\"description\":\"Frederick Surrey - Professional, calm, well spoken British narrator full of intrigue and wonder. Suitable for Nature, Science, Mystery \u0026 History documentaries or audio books \u0026 narration projects that need a smooth \u0026 velvety tone. \"},{\"voiceId\":\"MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC\",\"name\":\"Jon - Support Agent\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-prod/database/user/Pqevx83RzfcSiL8B6xWJ034oVoy1/voices/MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC/c6a1f8c4-0ac5-4023-99d4-25cf96ce5d2e.mp3\",\"category\":\"Narration\",\"description\":\"A warm, trustworthy American voice with a mature and grounded tone. Ideal for narration and commercials. It carries an intelligent and calm presence, making it perfect for delivering messages with clarity.\"}],\"initialLanguage\":\"en\",\"initialText\":\"In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. [sarcastically] Not the “burn it all down” kind... [giggles] but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. [whispers] Even the birds fell silent when he passed.\",\"variant\":\"default\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"b3:[\"$\",\"$Ld7\",null,{\"initialVoices\":\"$ab:props:initialVoices\",\"initialLanguage\":\"en\",\"initialText\":\"In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, l